  "coverage": "complete",
  "notes": [
    "Complete list: 10 actions and no feedbacks (src/actions.js registers one setActionDefinitions call; no setFeedbackDefinitions call exists in the module).",
    "The module sends OSC to the console (host, port 7000 by default; the console needs OSC In enabled, see src/index.js getConfigFields). The manifest lists only the product \"Hog 4\"; operation with HogPC or Hog 4 OS is not stated in the module source and was not verified.",
    "Dropdown ids are strings, including the numeric-looking ones (playback type 0/1/2, press/release 1/0). The actions pass them through parseFloat (action) or into the OSC path (type), so keep the string form.",
    "The masterKey action reuses the option id \"type\" (Key choices: choose, go, pause, goback, flash) and builds /hog/hardware/<type>/<mId>; the hardwareKey action reuses \"type\" for the key list. The Master Number 0 means the grand master (field tooltip).",
    "The H Key Number has min 1 and no max. The \"range\" flags of the number fields in src/setup.js are UI slider hints and are not recorded.",
    "Built on @companion-module/base ~1.10: options do not support expressions."
  ],
